00:05:22,105 --> 00:05:28,105
Who says you're only young once?

2
00:10:44,210 --> 00:10:50,210
17 Again is a comedy, fantasy, drama film directed by Burr Steers.

3
00:16:06,315 --> 00:16:12,315
On the brink of a midlife crisis, 30-something Mike O'Donnell wishes he could have a "do-over." And
that's exactly what he gets when he wakes up one morning to find he's 17 years old again.

4
00:21:28,421 --> 00:21:34,421
With his adult mind stuck inside the body of a teenager, Mike actually has the
chance to reverse some decisions he wishes he'd never made.

5
00:26:50,526 --> 00:26:56,526
But maybe they weren't so bad after all.

6
