12
01:04:25,263 --> 01:04:31,263
17 Again is a 2009 American teen fantasy comedy film directed
by Burr Steers and written by Jason Filardi.

13
01:09:47,368 --> 01:09:53,368
It stars Zac Efron, Leslie Mann, Thomas Lennon, and Michelle Trachtenberg, with
Melora Hardin, Sterling Knight, and Matthew Perry in supporting roles.

14
01:15:09,473 --> 01:15:15,473
The film follows a 37-year-old man (Perry) who becomes his
17-year-old self (Efron) after a chance accident.

15
01:20:31,578 --> 01:20:37,578
The film was released in the United States by Warner Bros.

16
01:25:53,684 --> 01:25:59,684
Pictures on April 17, 2009, to mixed reviews from critics, and was a
box-office success, grossing $139.5 million on a $40 million budget.

17
01:31:15,789 --> 01:31:21,789
The film explores themes of high school, affectation,
time travel, fake identity, bullying.

18
01:36:37,894 --> 01:36:43,894
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
